// 帳小簿 V26.79 — 週期與分期進階：起始期數、每週多天、週期轉帳、修改／終止未來、提前繳清.
// Bundled after js/loan-plus.js. Function declarations / var only.

// Next date of a weekly rule that runs on several weekdays (r.days = [0..6], 0 = Sunday).
